{
  "key": 28403,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "The Colosseum upstairs is for\n",
        "link battles.\r",
        "Battle records, such as how many times\n",
        "you had link battles and the results,\f",
        "are recorded on the back of your\f",
        "Trainer Card."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00001",
      "en_US": "Oh, you are a Team Rocket member..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "I wonder how many kinds of Pokémon\n",
        "there are in the world.\r",
        "A long time ago, Professor Oak said\n",
        "there were 150 different kinds...\r",
        "Since then, many new Pokémon have\n",
        "been discovered in different regions.\r",
        "There are almost 500 different kinds\n",
        "known now..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00003",
      "en_US": "Team Rocket...!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "A higher level Pokémon doesn’t\n",
        "always win.\r",
        "After all, it may have a type\n",
        "disadvantage.\r",
        "I don’t think there is a single\n",
        "Pokémon that is the toughest."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "I think I’ve met you before...\r",
        "You must have a reason for\n",
        "looking like that...?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, I don’t mind restoring a Pokémon’s\n",
        "health, even when they belong to\f",
        "Team Rocket...\r",
        "But stay away from other places, OK?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, hello there, trainer!\r",
        "Would you like to take a quiz? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Excellent! Let’s get started!\r",
        "Question one!\r",
        "Is it true that Giovanni owns\n",
        "a Level 54 Nidoqueen in Yellow? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00009",
      "en_US": "Aww... come back again!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m sorry, but that’s the wrong\n",
        "answer! Please, come and try again!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Correct! Time for question number two!\r",
        "Can Pikachu learn Surf\n",
        "within Pokémon Yellow? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Correct! The semifinal question!\r",
        "Can Magmar learn Overheat\n",
        "in Fire Red or Leaf Green? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Correct! The final question!\r",
        "Is it true that Nidorina and\n",
        "Nidoqueen cannot breed? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations!\n",
        "You completed the quiz!\r",
        "You can now pick a prized Pokémon!\n",
        "Which would you like?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Eh?\n",
        "You don’t want any of them?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00016",
      "en_US": "Turtwig"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00017",
      "en_US": "Chimchar"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00018",
      "en_US": "Piplup"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00019",
      "en_US": "Cancel"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Uhh...\n",
        "Your party is too full..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Woohoo!\n",
        "Look out for more of us Quiz Masters!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00022",
      "en_US": "As you wish!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00023",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a\n",
        "nickname to {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00025",
      "en_US": "Which Pokémon do you want?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Brain is better than brawn!\r",
        "Try this TM out and I bet you’ll\n",
        "agree!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "Calm Mind raises the special stats\n",
        "of a Pokémon that uses it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "Brawn is better than brain!\r",
        "Try this TM out and I bet you’ll\n",
        "agree!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "Bulk Up raises the physical stats\n",
        "of a Pokémon that uses it!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
